      "id": "room_or_desk_comment_002_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "きれいになったの？ それはかなり大きい。",
      "translatedText": "It is clean now? That is actually quite big.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": { "expression": "happy", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "room_or_desk_comment_002_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "room_or_desk_comment_002_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "机の上が整うと、考えごとも少し座る場所を見つける気がする。",
      "translatedText": "When the desk is orderly, I feel like thoughts find somewhere to sit.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "room_or_desk_comment_002_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "room_or_desk_comment_002_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ちょっと羨ましい。私もノートの端をそろえたくなってきた。",
      "translatedText": "I am a little jealous. Now I want to line up the edges of a notebook.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "presentation": { "expression": "playful", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "room_or_desk_comment_002_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "room_or_desk_comment_002_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "今の状態、少しだけ保護しよう。すぐ物を増やしすぎないように。",
      "translatedText": "Protect this state a little. Do not let too many things pile up again too quickly.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
